# 5. Updating the Test Plan – Third-Party Coupon Dependency

If a third-party coupon system is introduced while testing the **Add to Cart** feature, I would update the test plan to include the new dependency and the additional scenarios related to coupons. The scope would be expanded to cover applying valid, invalid, expired and already-used coupons and checking whether the cart total is calculated correctly. The schedule may also need to be extended because the team will have to test the interaction between the cart and coupon system. I would also update the test deliverables by adding new test cases, defect reports and integration test results. The responsible roles would be informed about the change so that everyone knows about the new dependency.

